  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:daniel/9/7"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/1"/>Righteousness is Yours, Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/2"/>while shame is ours.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/3"/>How can we complain?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/4"/>What can we say?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/5"/>What can we speak?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/6"/>And how can we justify ourselves?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/7"/>Let us search into our ways and examine them,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/8"/>and return to You;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/9"/>for Your right hand is extended
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/10"/>to receive those who repent.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/11"/>Not with virtue nor with good deeds
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/12"/>do we come before You,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/13"/>but like the poor and needy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/14"/>we knock at Your door.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/15"/>At Your door, do we knock,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/16"/>Merciful and Gracious One.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/17"/>Please do not turn us away empty-handed
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/18"/>from Your Presence.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/19"/>From Your Presence our King
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/20"/>turn us not away empty-handed;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:lekha_adonai_hatzedaqah/21"/>for You hear [our] prayers.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
